          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.dataDownload.DataDownload.encodingFormat.comment" xmi:uuid="3bcf31e6-534b-5332-8718-28f2eaa6bb94">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

MIME type with extension; should indicate the serialization scheme in sufficient detail that machine can know how to parse.</body>
